Dragon Fury (2026-11-02): the game's overlay (HUB, Gateway, Tag Team...) with the image stretched to a non 16:9 screen (Cube, 1:1):
one scale per axis in GameArea, and a uniform area for the Budokai 2 screens. On Android the Gateway points to Settings > Gateway
(no file picker in the game) and says that the Mod Kit modes are not available.

